{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 11 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">物理约束重建：从后处理到展开优化与测量一致性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Physics-Informed Recon</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_117_automap-title\">AUTOMAP</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">AUTOMAP 的标志是大规模全连接层直接承担 domain transform，而非先做 FBP/IFFT 再用 CNN 后处理。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Learns the sensor-to-image domain transform directly via large fully connected layers mapping flattened raw measurements to an image grid followed by sparse convolutional refinement.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">MRI k-space、CT 投影等序列化测量向量</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Flattened raw sensor measurement vector (e.g., k-space samples or Radon projections)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">重建图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Reconstructed spatial-domain image</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.15</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/nature25988\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_117_automap')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_117_automap')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"AUTOMAP original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/2841a2f5cf19fa50e6d6.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.15</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 7 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_117_automap', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_117_automap\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_117_automap')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_117_automap', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_117_automap\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">测量域向量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">measurement domain vector y</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">复数 k-space 或投影数据按实数通道展开</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests flattened raw sensor measurement vector (e.g., k-space samples or radon projections) and prepares initial tensor representations (measurement domain vector y).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"复数 k-space 或投影数据按实数通道展开\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests flattened raw sensor measurement vector (e.g., k-space samples or radon projections) and prepares initial tensor representations (measurement domain vector y).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"测量域向量 y\" data-node-name-en=\"measurement domain vector y\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_117_automap', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">测量域向量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">measurement domain vector y</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">复数 k-space 或投影数据按实数通道展开</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests flattened raw sensor measurement vector (e.g., k-space samples or radon projections) and prepares initial tensor representations (measurement domain vector y).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从测量坐标学习到高维隐空间的稠密映射\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes fully connected domain transform 1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"全连接 domain transform 1\" data-node-name-en=\"fully connected domain transform 1\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_117_automap', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全连接 domain transform 1</span><span class=\"lang-en\">fully connected domain transform 1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从测量坐标学习到高维隐空间的稠密映射</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes fully connected domain transform 1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"继续逼近傅里叶/投影逆变换对应的流形映射\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs fully connected domain transform 2 within the core fully connected sensor domain manifold computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"全连接 domain transform 2\" data-node-name-en=\"fully connected domain transform 2\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_117_automap', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全连接 domain transform 2</span><span class=\"lang-en\">fully connected domain transform 2</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">继续逼近傅里叶/投影逆变换对应的流形映射</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs fully connected domain transform 2 within the core fully connected sensor domain manifold computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将稠密隐向量恢复为图像网格\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 2D within the core fully connected sensor domain manifold computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"二维重排\" data-node-name-en=\"2D\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_117_automap', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">二维重排</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将稠密隐向量恢复为图像网格</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 2D within the core fully connected sensor domain manifold computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在图像域去除残余伪影并利用局部结构\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs convolution within the core fully connected sensor domain manifold computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"卷积细化层\" data-node-name-en=\"convolution\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_117_automap', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">卷积细化层</span><span class=\"lang-en\">convolution</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在图像域去除残余伪影并利用局部结构</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs convolution within the core fully connected sensor domain manifold computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"测量输入与目标图像直接成对训练\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 06 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"端到端图像监督\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 06\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_117_automap', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">端到端图像监督</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 06</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">测量输入与目标图像直接成对训练</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 06 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"网络一次前向产生结果\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces reconstructed spatial-domain image via Reconstructed Image.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"重建图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Reconstructed Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_117_automap', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">重建图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Reconstructed Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">网络一次前向产生结果</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces reconstructed spatial-domain image via Reconstructed Image.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"AUTOMAP Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 从传感域到图像域的端到端逆映射</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Fully Connected Sensor-to-Image Domain Transform Manifold Learning</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"AUTOMAP：核心公式 · 从传感域到图像域的端到端逆映射\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"117\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"21.310522pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.279199 -69.011212 311.217595 21.310522\" width=\"311.217595pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.876374-.753538L3.760445-.84773C3.695235-.78252 3.659008-.71731 3.593797-.659346C3.36194-.39126 3.246011-.275331 3.130082-.275331C3.050381-.275331 2.992416-.32605 2.992416-.39126C2.992416-.449225 3.014153-.58689 3.093854-.84773L3.42715-2.340316C3.463377-2.514209 3.499605-2.651875 3.49236-2.753313C3.485114-3.014153 3.318466-3.195292 2.999662-3.195292C2.477981-3.195292 1.934564-2.767804 1.173781-1.601269L1.68097-3.180801L1.601269-3.195292L.275331-2.970679L.282577-2.85475C.710065-2.847505 .818748-2.804032 .818748-2.65912C.825994-2.615647 .818748-2.572174 .811503-2.535946L.115929 0H.746293C1.086834-1.144798 1.15929-1.304201 1.499831-1.796899C1.956301-2.470736 2.369298-2.825768 2.673611-2.825768C2.796786-2.825768 2.825768-2.746067 2.833014-2.615647C2.833014-2.5287 2.796786-2.325825 2.731576-2.064984L2.441754-.869467C2.347561-.492698 2.325825-.398506 2.325825-.32605C2.340316-.050719 2.46349 .06521 2.738821 .06521C3.115591 .06521 3.318466-.079701 3.876374-.753538Z\" id=\"m117_g10-