link:href=\"#m117_g13-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"111.854348\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g13-92\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"116.502209\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g10-162\" y=\"-62.931518\"></use><use x=\"124.705849\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g1-61\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"133.809418\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g20-97\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"138.232832\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g20-114\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"141.400945\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g20-103\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"148.042664\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g20-109\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"155.793597\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g20-105\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"158.56321\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g20-110\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"153.999062\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g10-92\" y=\"-52.400483\"></use><use x=\"165.204929\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g4-213\" y=\"-69.011212\"></use><use x=\"169.769773\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g10-61\" y=\"-47.7659\"></use><use x=\"180.544031\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g7-107\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"186.760715\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g13-53\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"190.320867\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g10-92\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"195.597129\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g7-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"199.711694\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g13-72\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"204.679072\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g10-61\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"209.373558\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g7-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"215.4031\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g7-0\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"223.953201\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g13-71\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"228.820951\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g10-61\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"234.01357\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g7-107\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"238.496756\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g17-50\" y=\"-62.931518\"></use><use x=\"238.496756\" xlink:href=\"#m117_g17-50\" y=\"-55.790815\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">传统重建需手工推导逆算子且难联合优化所有处理步骤</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Conventional pipelines treated Fourier/Radon inversion as fixed analytical steps separate from downstream denoising.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以全连接域变换层加卷积网络端到端学习测量域到图像域映射</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Frame tomographic reconstruction as a data-driven manifold mapping between sensor and image domains parameterized by dense fully connected layers.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">首次展示跨 MRI、CT 等成像问题直接学习重建映射的统一思路</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Unified end-to-end neural domain transformation across arbitrary k-space trajectories and projection geometries on small grids.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">奠定端到端医学重建范式并推动 learned reconstruction</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Historically provocative demonstration of learned sensor-to-image inversion in low-resolution MRI and PET.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">历史里程碑；全连接层参数巨大、算子迁移和物理一致性较弱</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Historical curiosity rather than a scalable baseline: O(N⁴) fully connected parameters cannot scale to clinical 512²/3D grids and discard known Fourier/Radon physics.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">不显式编码解析逆变换，而以稠密层学习测量坐标到图像坐标的全局映射。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">域变换后用卷积利用自然/医学图像的局部结构进行细化。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">通过端到端配对监督把成像逆问题写成单一可微网络。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Frame tomographic reconstruction as a data-driven manifold mapping between sensor and image domains parameterized by dense fully connected layers.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Unified end-to-end neural domain transformation across arbitrary k-space trajectories and projection geometries on small grids.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Fully Connected Sensor-to-Image Domain Transform Manifold Learning.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">历史上证明 MRI、CT 等测量域到图像域可直接学习，推动 learned reconstruction。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">全连接层参数随测量和图像尺寸急剧增长，且扫描几何改变后难复用；没有显式数据一致性保证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Historically provocative demonstration of learned sensor-to-image inversion in low-resolution MRI and PET.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Historical curiosity rather than a scalable baseline: O(N⁴) fully connected parameters cannot scale to clinical 512²/3D grids and discard known Fourier/Radon physics.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/nature25988\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Image Reconstruction by Domain-Transform Manifold Learning</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/MattRosenLab/AUTOMAP\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
